{"logId": "6bccd2fa-c3bd-428e-9b22-271d2d6525a8", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 135, 1083, 254], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 254.0], [839.0, 254.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "回家", "block_bbox": [200, 228, 361, 282], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 228.0], [361.0, 228.0], [361.0, 282.0], [200.0, 282.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：服饰部/吕彤", "block_bbox": [214, 293, 360, 315], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[214.0, 293.0], [359.0, 293.0], [359.0, 314.0], [214.0, 314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "那一天，我像往常一样在东门口站岗。", "block_bbox": [238, 329, 561, 355], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 329.0], [561.0, 329.0], [561.0, 355.0], [238.0, 355.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "下午六点左右，从卖场跑出来一个七八岁的小男孩对我说：“叔叔，帮我找找姐姐吧？我找不到她。”“好的，小朋友，来，站叔叔旁边，我帮你找姐姐。”我通过店内广播在卖场寻找了几遍后，依然没有见到小朋友姐姐的到来。这时天快黑了，看到小朋友焦急的表情，我心里也很担心。我就问：“你家人的电话你知道吗？”“不知道！”“那你家在哪儿呀？”“八一路。”随后我就领着他到门口找了一个我认识的三轮车，临上车的时候，我给师傅5元钱，并把我的电话号码留给那个小男孩，对他说：“到家后一定给叔叔打个电话，让叔叔知道你到家了。”回到卖场，我心里有些担心，一会儿一看表，都已经十几分钟了，怎么电话还不响呢？正当我焦虑的时候，突然电话响了，小男孩的声音又回响在耳边：“叔叔，我到家了，谢谢你！”接到这个电话，我悬着的心才安定下来，心里特别幸福和温暖。", "block_bbox": [198, 365, 976, 636], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 365.0], [976.0, 365.0], [976.0, 636.0], [198.0, 636.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [200, 643, 703, 704], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 643.0], [703.0, 643.0], [703.0, 704.0], [200.0, 704.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "侯芳编者按：", "block_bbox": [238, 713, 352, 738], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 713.0], [352.0, 713.0], [352.0, 738.0], [238.0, 738.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一方水土，养一方人。胖东来肥沃而独特的文化土壤培养了我们每一位胖东来人，从高层到员工，我们能以良好的心态，以坦荡的胸怀迎接每天的挑战，经受了顾客的考验，虽然我们不敢讲已经读懂了人生，读懂了社会，读懂了市场，但可以自信地说，我们正在成熟，不在幼稚，不在迷茫。虽然我们同过去一样，很忙，很累。但忙得有序，累的快乐，眼前有了开阔的道路，有了更明确的目标。今天，在这里，让我们每一位优秀的团队舵手主激情开航。", "block_bbox": [197, 747, 703, 1021], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 747.0], [703.0, 747.0], [703.0, 1021.0], [197.0, 1021.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [712, 668, 940, 990], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[712.0, 668.0], [940.0, 668.0], [940.0, 990.0], [712.0, 990.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "我给顾客做榜样", "block_bbox": [110, 1406, 367, 1449], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [367.0, 1406.0], [367.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1001, 609, 1138, 725], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[1001.0, 609.0], [1138.0, 609.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1001.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.8378981947898865, "coordinate": [839, 135, 1083, 254], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 254.0], [839.0, 254.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8315061926841736, "coordinate": [200, 228, 361, 282], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[200.0, 228.0], [361.0, 228.0], [361.0, 282.0], [200.0, 282.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7581315636634827, "coordinate": [214, 293, 360, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[214.0, 293.0], [359.0, 293.0], [359.0, 314.0], [214.0, 314.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7315958738327026, "coordinate": [238, 329, 561, 355], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 329.0], [561.0, 329.0], [561.0, 355.0], [238.0, 355.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9421095848083496, "coordinate": [198, 365, 976, 636], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 365.0], [976.0, 365.0], [976.0, 636.0], [198.0, 636.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.818012535572052, "coordinate": [200, 643, 703, 704], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[200.0, 643.0], [703.0, 643.0], [703.0, 704.0], [200.0, 704.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.70927894115448, "coordinate": [238, 713, 352, 738], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 713.0], [352.0, 713.0], [352.0, 738.0], [238.0, 738.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9518670439720154, "coordinate": [197, 747, 703, 1021], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 747.0], [703.0, 747.0], [703.0, 1021.0], [197.0, 1021.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9441996812820435, "coordinate": [712, 668, 940, 990], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[712.0, 668.0], [940.0, 668.0], [940.0, 990.0], [712.0, 990.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8465167880058289, "coordinate": [110, 1406, 367, 1449], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [367.0, 1406.0], [367.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5853191018104553, "coordinate": [1001, 609, 1138, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1001.0, 609.0], [1138.0, 609.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1001.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 回家\n\n作者：服饰部/吕彤\n\n那一天，我像往常一样在东门口站岗。\n\n下午六点左右，从卖场跑出来一个七八岁的小男孩对我说：“叔叔，帮我找找姐姐吧？我找不到她。”“好的，小朋友，来，站叔叔旁边，我帮你找姐姐。”我通过店内广播在卖场寻找了几遍后，依然没有见到小朋友姐姐的到来。这时天快黑了，看到小朋友焦急的表情，我心里也很担心。我就问：“你家人的电话你知道吗？”“不知道！”“那你家在哪儿呀？”“八一路。”随后我就领着他到门口找了一个我认识的三轮车，临上车的时候，我给师傅5元钱，并把我的电话号码留给那个小男孩，对他说：“到家后一定给叔叔打个电话，让叔叔知道你到家了。”回到卖场，我心里有些担心，一会儿一看表，都已经十几分钟了，怎么电话还不响呢？正当我焦虑的时候，突然电话响了，小男孩的声音又回响在耳边：“叔叔，我到家了，谢谢你！”接到这个电话，我悬着的心才安定下来，心里特别幸福和温暖。\n\n\n\n侯芳编者按：\n\n一方水土，养一方人。胖东来肥沃而独特的文化土壤培养了我们每一位胖东来人，从高层到员工，我们能以良好的心态，以坦荡的胸怀迎接每天的挑战，经受了顾客的考验，虽然我们不敢讲已经读懂了人生，读懂了社会，读懂了市场，但可以自信地说，我们正在成熟，不在幼稚，不在迷茫。虽然我们同过去一样，很忙，很累。但忙得有序，累的快乐，眼前有了开阔的道路，有了更明确的目标。今天，在这里，让我们每一位优秀的团队舵手主激情开航。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_712_668_940_990.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"19%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 我给顾客做榜样\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1138_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_254.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6bccd2fa-c3bd-428e-9b22-271d2d6525a8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_254.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A03Z%2F-1%2F%2F2c4f59b892abb7b099bbf255610445ec105b4cc068cab3d6ed9d468d983e8e7c", "imgs/img_in_image_box_712_668_940_990.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6bccd2fa-c3bd-428e-9b22-271d2d6525a8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_712_668_940_990.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A04Z%2F-1%2F%2Faf9a0b335c7642ea9485a13bf4fc0cacdfc2b5e3a3662e6b3d8943e4582e02ff", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1138_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6bccd2fa-c3bd-428e-9b22-271d2d6525a8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1138_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2F4e8c382124e3bba7d57875e2e94b40e20915150477d7046cc3220c21102ee6d2"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "h